# Docs: https://www.chezmoi.io/reference/special-files/chezmoiexternal-format/
# Theme files are pinned to one fmind/theme commit with checksums because several execute
# (Neovim Lua, Git includes); `mise run upgrade` advances the pin via dot_tasks.theme_pin.
# Configs that cannot include a theme file copy its block instead; theme_pin refuses a pin they no longer match.
# DESIGN.md, the Fmind design system, shares the pin so agents read the same revision as the themes.
{{ $base := "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fmind/theme/539f45b1c96787f8ac6944c5f7aabb24e4017773" }}

[".agents/DESIGN.md"]
